    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueText.dialogue.Array.data[2].name
      value: Me
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueText.dialogue.Array.data[3].name
      value: Me
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueText.dialogue.Array.data[4].name
      value: Me
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueText.dialogue.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: School is okay.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueText.dialogue.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: I mean, I don't hate it or anything - people are usually pretty nice
        and all.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueText.dialogue.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: But I usually just look at my hands and wait for the time to pass.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueText.dialogue.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: It's like a movie, kinda. The type your dad has on, and it's neat, but
        not really your thing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueText.dialogue.Array.data[4].dialogue
      value: It's - funny, I get so restless as home, but then I leave, and just
        wish I was back in my room...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
      propertyPath: task.ThoughtText.dialogue.Array.data[0].name
      value: Me
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 966868564021206957, guid: 1d237f6ce9410a847812f7e5ab034948, type: 3}
